 "remarks": "An exceptional opportunity awaits in the coveted private Pine Point Association, one of Rowayton's most sought-after waterfront enclaves. Perfectly positioned to capture panoramic views of picturesque Farm Creek and just 200 yards to South Beach, this property's true allure lies in its remarkable location and endless potential. An extraordinary setting in which to create your dream coastal retreat, surrounded by the natural beauty and timeless charm of this treasured neighborhood. Whether you're a beachgoer, kayaker, boater, avid walker, or simply someone who appreciates the serenity of life by the water, this special location offers something for everyone. Imagine having the very best of Rowayton's shoreline lifestyle right outside your door. Come see for yourself!",
